      "text": "# SPOOL — The Job — flow\n\n**Card** SPOOL\n**Day** 1\n\nChapter note: [[02 SPOOL — The Job]]\n\n---\n\nWorking surface, not canon. Fill from the chapter note, never the other way round. 🔧 marks nothing settled.\n\nStructure: [[The Day Loop]] · [[Saving]]\nLocks: [[Scope Ledger]]"
