      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Work order\n\n- Certify corridor 2. 🔧 Plus 1–2 mundane jobs.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "puzzles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 398,
      "text": "## Puzzles\n\n- **The Payout.** NOTICE the tape passing the Schedule's number → VERIFY with [[The Ruler]] → ACT: sign a DISCREPANCY → PAYOFF: the work-order line closes and the measure is fixed under [[Clause 02 — The Measure]]. It opens nothing — certificates never do, see [[Locks and Openers]].\n- 🔧 **What opens 242's far door is still unassigned.**\n- **The teaching pocket.** [[Clause 02 — The Measure]] taught fully. The nest is seen and left — no light verb exists yet.\n- **The smoke-locked door.** Cannot be opened from the corridor, now or ever. See [[The Sleep Maze]].",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mazepocket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 668,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Maze / pocket\n\n- [[Teaching Pocket]] · [[Mirror Maze]], all three layers.",
      "color": "1"
