      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 216,
      "text": "## Photographs\n\n- Mirror maze, one clear frontal per layer. The contact sheet develops **standing · rushing the camera · a raven**, then the beach mind-space. See [[The Delusions]].\n- The west-face shot develops as the back of his own head, once.",
      "color": "5"
