    {
      "id": "nightdream",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 268,
      "text": "## Night & dream\n\n- Tape #2. **Dream 1** — [[The Ward]], [[Eve]]: \"Visiting hours end at three.\" She tells him Anna is dead, and not how.\n- **Eve gives the flashgun.** The player knows where it is for and the demo ends before they can go.\n- **3:00 AM ring — [[Anna]] calls.** Her name in the dialogue box for the first time; one ordinary line. **Demo ends.**",
      "color": "6"
    }
